  },
  "hot": {
   "_comment": "The first tables are the hot set: commits from the arrival rate never go there; writers_per_table writers per table commit in a loop with pause_ms between commits, so commits collide and the 409 path runs. They run whenever a profile commits. pause_ms was 2000 until Tier D's attempt 5 on 2026-10-16 (#174): the hot set then sent about 19 commits/s whatever the profile's rate, and one Polaris replica's mixed profile failed its first step at 25 req/s.",
